          },
          {
            "en": "All Gargantuars gain +20% movement speed, with altered imp-throwing health threshold",
            "zh": "所有巨人的移动速度+20%，投掷小鬼的血线变化"
          },
          {
            "en": "All Troglobite gain +80% health and movement speed, with increased ice block quantity containing more zombie types, and different zombies frozen in initial ice blocks",
            "zh": "所有推冰僵尸的生命值和移动速度+80%，冰块数量增加且包含的僵尸种类更多，初始冰块冻住的僵尸有所不同"
          },
          {
            "en": "Slider positions are altered, with additional sliders appearing",
            "zh": "浮冰位置变化，出现额外浮冰"
          },
          {
            "en": "Some waves and dynamic spawning are modified",
            "zh": "部分波次和动态出怪有所不同"
          }
